OL,5,G0200 Radio 2's Movie Music - Scotland
OL,6,     F9/26. In advance of Radio 2 In The
OL,7,     FPark visiting Stirling in
OL,8,     FSeptember 2026, Edith Bowman
OL,9,     Fcelebrates the cinematic sonic
OL,10,     Flegacy of Scotland.
OL,11,G0300 Dolly Parton: The Fans' Story
OL,12,     FIn tribute to Dolly, originally
OL,13,     Fbroadcast to mark the 80th
OL,14,     Fbirthday of this legendary artist,
OL,15,     Fher celebrity fans pay tribute to
OL,16,     Fher music, her style, her legacy.
